Agents in this directory vendored from affaan-m/ecc (MIT), 2026-09-14.

Chosen to match the stack this harness is used on — FastAPI, PostgreSQL +
pgvector, TypeScript/React — because a generic reviewer catches generic bugs:

  fastapi-reviewer       async correctness, DI, Pydantic schemas, OpenAPI
  database-reviewer      query plans, indexes, RLS, migration safety
  typescript-reviewer    type soundness, strict-mode gaps
  react-reviewer         render correctness, effect misuse
  rag-pipeline-reviewer  retrieval + embedding pipeline review
  tdd-guide              red/green/refactor discipline

Already present before this date, byte-identical to their ECC originals and
previously uncredited — this file corrects that attribution:

  code-reviewer          silent-failure-hunter  opensource-sanitizer

python-reviewer shares a name with ECC's but has diverged; ours is the
smaller, older fork and was not resynced. See VENDOR-MINING.md.
